title: "BTK Field App — ბტკ საველე აპლიკაცია"
abstract: >
  A free, open-source field survey platform for landscape natural-territorial complexes (NTC/BTC),
  developed by the Georgian Cartographers Association and Tbilisi State University.
  Runs on Android, Windows, Linux, and the web.
